# Top-level dependencies — edit this file, then regenerate pinned outputs with:
#   pip-compile --no-header --no-annotate requirements.in --output-file requirements.txt
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --constraint requirements.txt requirements.in --output-file requirements.lock
#
# Staging AND production install requirements.lock (hash-pinned, all transitive
# deps), so production runs exactly what staging tested. requirements.txt is kept
# for Dependabot, which only bumps that file: after a Dependabot PR, regenerate
# the lock with the second command above. tests/test_requirements_sync.py fails
# CI until both files pin identical versions.

